# Normalize line endings. Shell scripts MUST be LF so shebangs and heredocs parse on every
# platform (see SW-21). PowerShell scripts pinned to LF for cross-platform parity; PS 5.1 reads
# either, and consistency is cheap. Pure-ASCII rule for *.ps1 (CLAUDE.md) is unaffected by eol.
* text=auto

*.sh  text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
